WEBVTT

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:18.620
An eerie comet that came from beyond the universe scattered fear all over the Earth.

00:01:56.560 --> 00:01:58.180
A giant meteorite force collided with it.

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:00.790
The Great Earthquake is happening.

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:11.660
One of them, the Earthquake that hit Kanto, is known as the Kanto Earthquake.

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:26.440
But the real fear will begin after this.

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:57.880
And Kanto, who became the lawless land of weak meat and strong food.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:05.040
Here, a man who wants to build a war-torn nation by force has appeared.

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:43.240
There was a giant being who could break the ambitions of the Demon King Slam King.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:08.440
The muscles are like a gorilla, the fangs are like a wolf, and the burning eyes are like a atomic bomb.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:39.280
Oh!

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:06.950
Those burning eyes had the shine of wisdom.

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:07.650
Die!

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:30.410
Thank you.

00:06:02.810 --> 00:06:03.050
We'll be right back.

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:34.230
That monster won't die like a tsunami.

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.380
He's still alive.

00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:39.070
You bastards!

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:42.280
Those who have more power than me in this world

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:43.140
can't live!

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:47.890
Kill that guy, Violet Jack!

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:08.160
How's the product going?

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:17.120
Hey, it's a good one.

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:19.990
You've got a lot of girls this time.

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:21.590
All of them are good girls.

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:24.380
I can't wait to be a woman slave before I die.

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:51.250
It's a precious prey. I won't let you get away with it.

00:08:05.970 --> 00:08:23.680
Thank you. I'm Yumi.

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:25.020
I'm Mario.

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:30.920
Why did you come to this town?

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:32.080
Why?

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:36.400
What are you looking for?

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:37.780
Someone important?

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:17.510
He died at that time.

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:21.620
At that time, I heard the rumor that he was alive through the wind.

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:25.770
It's not like that, but I've been looking for a lot of places.

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:32.800
I want to check this town too, if I can find any clues.

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:35.100
No, it's dangerous here.

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:35.740
What?

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:38.780
You'd better run away to your family.

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:40.820
There's no time to go back.

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:48.010
Marisa, if they catch us, we won't be able to find that person.

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:52.000
Let's run away together.

00:10:04.730 --> 00:10:09.260
It's no use hiding. Come out! Don't waste your time!

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:30.400
AHHHHH!

00:11:09.116 --> 00:11:09.616
C'mon

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:31.510
What?

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:43.160
I thought you were a drunkard.

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:45.400
Again?

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:46.910
Stop it.

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:56.510
Are you in a coma?

00:11:57.380 --> 00:11:58.120
Hey, Sam!

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:09.470
After Jack left, the wilderness where the smell of death spread spread.

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:14.660
The huge jackknife that was hidden in his chest was used to fight against people's violence.

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:15.480
The light of the world is awakened.

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:20.450
The figure of the light causes fear and murder in the hearts of the witnesses.

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:25.390
But the only survivor sees the light of death in his burning eyes.

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:28.900
That is...

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.020
Violence Jack.

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:43.190
I think the boss and King are looking for him.

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.340
I'm sure he's that powerful.

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:48.800
It's Violence Jack.

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:50.960
Let King know right away.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:51.580
Wait.

00:12:52.030 --> 00:12:57.960
I don't know who he is, but he's the only one we have.

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:03.320
That's right. We'll do it on our own.

00:13:03.890 --> 00:13:13.220
He must be the monster called Violence Jack that King is looking for.

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:15.080
Sabu, hurry up and let us know.

00:13:15.180 --> 00:13:15.740
I don't want to.

00:13:15.780 --> 00:13:18.340
Jack said we were on the side of the weak.

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:19.200
He said he was a dead old man.

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:22.080
Don't talk so much.

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:24.310
If King's servants hear you,

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:25.590
we won't forgive you.

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:27.970
Besides, if you keep quiet about Jack staying here,

00:13:28.650 --> 00:13:29.960
we'll kill you.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:30.220
You will be killed.

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:32.240
Now, go quickly.

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:05.850
Jack isn't here, is he?

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:08.860
What do you mean?

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:11.040
He was here, indeed.

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:14.010
That big man must be the Violet Jack!

00:14:15.310 --> 00:14:17.280
Tch! Find him again!

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:18.240
Yes, sir!

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:25.910
Do it!

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:51.960
Yes, sir.

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:18.730
Ken, you're late.

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:21.260
I still came in a hurry.

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:25.220
They're all alone.

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:28.400
It can't be helped.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:29.970
They used to be Yakuza.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.510
It's a band of bandits. It won't be like a real army.

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:37.110
Captain! Jack is not around here!

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:41.610
Idiot! It's a man over 2 meters tall! Find him!

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:48.120
It's possible that he ran away and will come back.

00:16:22.650 --> 00:16:26.110
When you become a slave, you will be sold to the city ruled by the King.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:29.350
What do you say?

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:39.080
Even if you look like that, you'll end up in prison, and you won't be able to stand the desire to have sex.

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:43.830
Now, look over there.

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:53.950
Look carefully.

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:57.380
It's easier to be a slave if you feel humiliated like that.

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:04.200
You're the boss. I'll take care of everything.

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:11.550
You're the boss! You're all human beings!

00:17:11.770 --> 00:17:15.280
Yes, that's right, young lady.

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:17.090
Shut up!

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:37.760
Don't worry. I won't hurt you anymore.

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:40.390
If you go against me...

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:44.420
You're a good boy.

00:18:50.220 --> 00:18:51.680
What do you think of my skills?

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:55.580
Now, it's your turn.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:11.980
Hmph, it's a good thing.

00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:13.750
It's a waste of life outside.

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:14.570
Hm?

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:33.290
I can't!

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:38.660
At a time like this!

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:58.610
What?!

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:05.340
I'll take care of this girl!

00:20:06.570 --> 00:20:08.060
You can't do that.

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:12.340
I don't know why, but all the little girls I brought here are good-for-nothings.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:13.650
It's a problem if they do whatever they want.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:16.170
Please, just ignore this one.

00:20:16.890 --> 00:20:19.010
No! This is a must!

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:22.080
If you go against the rules, you'll be betrayed by Bomber-sama!

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:24.590
Only death will be betrayed by you!

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:26.880
You monster!

00:20:27.220 --> 00:20:29.590
Darn it! You stupid bastard!

00:21:00.410 --> 00:21:01.820
Captain C.A. escaped with two female slaves.

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:04.340
Arrest all three of them.

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:07.190
Captain C.A. escaped with two female slaves.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:09.530
Arrest all three of them.

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:19.600
We can't be found here.

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:22.540
We'll let you escape at night.

00:21:24.310 --> 00:21:25.540
We can't run away.

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:29.240
We owe the boss.

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:33.140
He saved me when I wandered in the wilderness and became a scarecrow of the night.

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:35.840
He taught me how to survive by using my own abilities.

00:21:38.140 --> 00:21:40.760
Mr. Kenichi, you've changed.

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:44.270
Everything in the world has changed.

00:21:44.430 --> 00:21:47.530
Mr. Kenichi, you did it!

00:22:07.230 --> 00:22:09.000
Mari, I won't leave you alone.

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:09.850
Keiichi-

00:22:38.510 --> 00:22:38.950
There's Mr. Oki!

00:22:47.380 --> 00:22:51.020
You're all dead!

00:22:51.560 --> 00:22:54.230
Boss, are you going to kill me too?

00:22:54.780 --> 00:22:57.780
Even if you're my captain, you can't break the rules.

00:23:03.130 --> 00:23:05.190
He's the one who told us about you guys.

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:10.290
It's a report from Reiza.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:32.730
I want to burn down the town and get rid of Jack.

00:23:33.030 --> 00:23:34.740
I don't care if the people in town die.

00:23:35.580 --> 00:23:36.120
Kill them!

00:23:36.440 --> 00:23:36.940
Yes, sir!

00:23:38.020 --> 00:23:40.280
Ken, kill Jack.

00:23:40.800 --> 00:23:43.400
If you kill him, the woman's life will be saved.

00:23:44.360 --> 00:23:47.650
Boss, I understand.

00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:48.670
I have to go!

00:23:48.790 --> 00:23:52.940
This is the only way to survive.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:28.840
I can't take it anymore!

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:31.370
Get rid of him!

00:24:31.630 --> 00:24:32.520
Get rid of him!

00:24:34.130 --> 00:24:36.120
Kill him if you can!

00:25:02.430 --> 00:25:04.830
It's Jack! He's going to make everyone's blood run cold!

00:25:08.820 --> 00:25:27.520
Even though it's a town that calls for blood, I can finally go to my mother.

00:25:43.630 --> 00:25:44.430
Damn it!

00:25:44.850 --> 00:25:46.670
Where's Jack?!

00:26:04.900 --> 00:26:07.390
I got this!

00:26:54.440 --> 00:26:54.720
Jack!

00:27:09.500 --> 00:27:10.640
Why can you stand still?

00:27:11.100 --> 00:27:20.720
Why didn't you kill me?

00:27:33.840 --> 00:27:35.440
What? Jack is in the castle?

00:27:37.360 --> 00:27:41.140
I didn't know he was that strong.

00:27:41.690 --> 00:27:42.870
Violence Jack.

00:28:02.300 --> 00:28:02.560
Yeah.

00:28:33.960 --> 00:28:44.980
I'm sorry, Marie.

00:28:46.060 --> 00:28:49.640
I'm so envious of you.

00:28:49.640 --> 00:28:52.770
I can't go back to where I was.

00:28:52.910 --> 00:28:54.960
You suddenly...

00:28:54.960 --> 00:28:58.270
That's enough.

00:29:00.250 --> 00:29:00.470
Yes!

00:29:00.530 --> 00:29:07.720
My girlfriend...

00:29:18.770 --> 00:29:20.860
No, the bodies can't go in.

00:29:20.900 --> 00:29:22.700
The reconnaissance gyro should be here.

00:29:22.880 --> 00:29:23.680
This way!

00:29:39.050 --> 00:29:46.610
Come on, let's go!

00:29:46.670 --> 00:29:46.870
Teru!

00:29:46.870 --> 00:29:48.830
Then...

00:29:48.830 --> 00:29:54.900
Tama! Why did you come to destroy this city?

00:29:55.880 --> 00:29:58.040
Don't ask such a question.

00:30:00.380 --> 00:30:02.220
Destruction will come to you as well.

00:30:02.240 --> 00:30:03.580
You shall die!

00:30:04.260 --> 00:30:04.650
Tch!

00:30:04.730 --> 00:30:08.110
Mari, now!

00:30:09.700 --> 00:30:09.980
Ken!

00:30:10.120 --> 00:30:10.400
Ah!

00:30:33.220 --> 00:30:47.290
If I take Jack's head, if I kill Jack, I can surpass the Slam King!

00:30:51.500 --> 00:30:52.580
Keiichi-san!

00:30:52.600 --> 00:30:56.140
Help me!

00:30:56.140 --> 00:30:56.580
It's okay.

00:30:56.780 --> 00:30:57.560
Look at that.

00:31:03.160 --> 00:31:04.810
It's no use. We managed to survive.

00:31:05.650 --> 00:31:08.700
At this rate, we won't be able to survive.

00:31:13.540 --> 00:31:15.800
Hey, stop!

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:30.320
I'm gonna live and die.

00:31:36.750 --> 00:31:46.940
It's the same thing.

00:32:30.600 --> 00:32:30.940
Yeah!

00:39:02.520 --> 00:39:03.580
It went well, didn't it?

00:39:03.580 --> 00:39:04.900
That idiot is not easy!

00:39:05.760 --> 00:39:08.860
Yeah, you're a little hard on the instrument.

00:39:09.100 --> 00:39:11.780
If it's here, they won't come either.

00:39:12.220 --> 00:39:13.910
Okay, let's eat here.

00:39:14.110 --> 00:39:14.450
What?

00:39:15.500 --> 00:39:18.140
It's going to be weird with just one can and these guys a day.

00:39:18.340 --> 00:39:19.300
That's right.

00:39:22.010 --> 00:39:24.750
Look, it's been a long time since I've been out on such a big beach.

00:39:25.050 --> 00:39:27.070
Wow, hurry up and share it with me.

00:39:27.330 --> 00:39:29.700
Don't panic, I'll do it now.

00:39:30.500 --> 00:39:35.270
Come on, have a good taste.

00:39:35.830 --> 00:39:37.210
What's wrong?

00:39:37.330 --> 00:39:40.470
I'm the one who stole it.

00:39:40.720 --> 00:39:46.460
I see. If you don't like it, don't eat it.

00:39:46.460 --> 00:39:49.180
I don't need it.

00:39:49.460 --> 00:39:50.420
I'm going to throw it away.

00:39:50.420 --> 00:39:53.770
You guys are in this hell.

00:39:54.030 --> 00:39:55.680
I didn't forget the rules to live.

00:39:57.020 --> 00:39:59.680
I don't have a heart.

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:01.800
And don't eat it yet.

00:40:02.040 --> 00:40:03.520
Please forgive me from the case.

00:40:04.200 --> 00:40:05.540
You guys are pigs.

00:40:06.040 --> 00:40:10.260
I was threatened and I had no choice but to do it.

00:40:10.320 --> 00:40:11.980
So please forgive me.

00:40:12.760 --> 00:40:13.880
It's hard for humans to survive.

00:40:15.620 --> 00:40:17.400
I don't have the right to live as a pig here.

00:40:18.960 --> 00:40:19.960
Wait for me.

00:40:20.400 --> 00:40:21.210
Stop it, uncle.

00:40:21.490 --> 00:40:23.060
I won't do it.

00:40:23.860 --> 00:40:24.280
Wake up.

00:40:26.180 --> 00:40:27.000
I'm going out.

00:40:27.040 --> 00:40:27.820
I'm going out.

00:40:28.360 --> 00:40:29.740
I can't go back.

00:40:30.120 --> 00:40:32.260
I promise you, it's true!

00:40:32.860 --> 00:40:33.550
Kubo!

00:40:34.310 --> 00:40:35.850
Turn off the lights, now!

00:40:36.100 --> 00:40:37.200
I got it!

00:40:42.100 --> 00:40:46.810
What are you going to do about Kurata?

00:40:47.090 --> 00:40:47.830
Don't worry.

00:40:48.290 --> 00:40:50.140
The Mads will take care of it.

00:40:50.400 --> 00:40:53.190
Tsudo, take Kenichi's body back to the store.

00:40:54.210 --> 00:40:55.920
But...

00:40:55.920 --> 00:40:58.060
It's the second case this month.

00:40:58.180 --> 00:40:59.210
We have to hurry.

00:41:00.640 --> 00:41:01.980
There will be another one who breaks the rules.

00:41:02.880 --> 00:41:04.720
Yes, sir.

00:41:05.800 --> 00:41:19.680
Boss, I heard that a pig with a ham from the A district wants to meet you.

00:41:20.240 --> 00:41:21.430
Bring me a ham.

00:41:26.530 --> 00:41:28.250
Come on, let's go.

00:41:29.170 --> 00:41:29.650
Yes, sir.

00:41:32.400 --> 00:41:34.790
Oh, a pig is wandering around.

00:41:36.300 --> 00:41:40.300
I can't eat just that.

00:41:41.000 --> 00:41:44.140
You have a good one, pig.

00:41:44.800 --> 00:41:46.900
I'll take care of you later.

00:41:47.620 --> 00:41:48.000
Please.

00:42:01.310 --> 00:42:01.650
What do you think?

00:42:03.200 --> 00:42:05.200
It's no use digging anymore. Let's stop.

00:42:05.700 --> 00:42:07.450
Don't give up.

00:42:07.690 --> 00:42:09.860
There's no mistake here even if you look at the map.

00:42:10.060 --> 00:42:10.940
But...

00:42:10.940 --> 00:42:12.320
Wait! Be quiet.

00:42:12.660 --> 00:42:14.270
Everyone, look closely at my shadow.

00:42:14.810 --> 00:42:15.600
Do you feel anything?

00:42:16.360 --> 00:42:18.540
The shadow is moving.

00:42:18.860 --> 00:42:20.470
It's true. It's moving.

00:42:20.850 --> 00:42:25.160
It's the wind. The wind is blowing.

00:42:25.460 --> 00:42:26.610
From somewhere in this hole.

00:42:43.210 --> 00:42:44.950
Alright, leave it to me!

00:42:44.990 --> 00:42:45.970
I can finally get out of this hell!

00:42:46.810 --> 00:42:48.380
It's true!

00:42:48.940 --> 00:42:51.710
That's why I came all the way here to help you!

00:42:52.710 --> 00:42:57.540
But you guys...

00:43:01.980 --> 00:43:04.050
How much power do you have to lend me?

00:43:06.170 --> 00:43:08.580
I'll do anything!

00:43:11.680 --> 00:43:14.480
Please believe me!

00:43:15.330 --> 00:43:17.640
Piggy, what do you believe in when you sell your friends?

00:43:19.520 --> 00:43:21.310
Touch me!

00:43:22.350 --> 00:43:25.950
Please help me!

00:43:26.450 --> 00:43:29.640
You think you're the only one who can help me?

00:43:31.340 --> 00:43:32.580
What a disgusting pig!

00:43:33.830 --> 00:43:40.350
Tachia, you're different from the pigs in the capital.

00:43:42.090 --> 00:43:45.880
Even if the pigs attack you, it won't hurt or it won't be itchy.

00:43:46.180 --> 00:43:48.320
I'll kill them all.

00:43:48.640 --> 00:43:51.200
So don't worry and die first.

00:43:52.860 --> 00:43:53.720
The sound is different!

00:43:54.140 --> 00:43:54.820
One more step!

00:43:55.200 --> 00:43:57.970
This is the wall of the building! We can get out!

00:43:58.110 --> 00:43:59.750
Watch out! It's going to collapse! Get away!

00:44:02.560 --> 00:44:09.580
We did it!

00:44:09.840 --> 00:44:13.220
Let's go!

00:44:30.320 --> 00:44:30.900
It's a titan.

00:44:32.180 --> 00:44:33.960
It's huge.

00:44:34.600 --> 00:44:34.840
What?

00:44:35.360 --> 00:44:40.740
It can't be.

00:44:41.260 --> 00:44:45.310
Is it a tree?

00:44:45.430 --> 00:44:46.820
Is it an ally?

00:44:47.100 --> 00:44:54.240
It's been here since it died.

00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:03.540
Mr. Takahori, it seems that the people of B-Squad have arrived here and are heading this way!

00:45:04.040 --> 00:45:06.180
But no.

00:45:06.400 --> 00:45:10.700
If we talk about this, we'll have a lot more heads!

00:45:11.260 --> 00:45:14.490
We have guns, so we'll take weapons and fight!

00:45:14.930 --> 00:45:15.710
That's right!

00:45:16.130 --> 00:45:17.370
All right, let's go.

00:45:17.430 --> 00:45:17.770
Wait!

00:45:19.070 --> 00:45:24.440
Let's just make an example of what we got from Hanagura.

00:45:35.120 --> 00:45:36.180
Don't look at me like that!

00:45:36.460 --> 00:45:36.560
What?

00:45:37.780 --> 00:45:39.120
You're so cute!

00:45:39.550 --> 00:45:49.510
What are you talking about?

00:45:49.610 --> 00:45:50.340
You're in my way.

00:45:50.480 --> 00:45:51.060
Get out of my way.

00:45:51.200 --> 00:45:53.210
You're so motivated.

00:45:53.850 --> 00:45:54.840
Heh heh.

00:45:55.180 --> 00:45:55.440
Ugh!

00:46:14.750 --> 00:46:16.140
Stop it!

00:46:16.300 --> 00:46:23.370
Don't throw the whole bike away with that!

00:46:23.410 --> 00:46:27.590
We can beat the Mads!

00:46:28.310 --> 00:46:29.380
Yeah...

00:46:30.000 --> 00:46:30.900
But that person is...

00:46:30.900 --> 00:46:35.040
The place where that giant was was a room surrounded by thick concrete walls.

00:46:35.220 --> 00:46:38.020
A person can't live in a place like that for six months.

00:46:38.460 --> 00:46:41.340
Is the appearance of that giant a foreshadowing for something to happen?

00:46:42.180 --> 00:46:46.100
Sudo, go ahead and tell the mayor about this.

00:46:46.100 --> 00:46:46.460
Yes.

00:46:46.560 --> 00:46:52.880
If you don't mind, can you meet our mayor?

00:47:01.600 --> 00:47:04.520
What? There's someone bigger than me in the A-Zone?

00:47:05.100 --> 00:47:06.200
Y-Yes...

00:47:06.680 --> 00:47:10.220
That guy flew away with Mike Morotomo in no time...

00:47:10.220 --> 00:47:13.520
There's no way there's someone bigger than me, right?

00:47:13.980 --> 00:47:15.400
Even if you say that...

00:47:15.780 --> 00:47:18.710
You've made a fool out of your friends and escaped.

00:47:20.030 --> 00:47:21.170
That's enough, boss.

00:47:21.610 --> 00:47:23.860
Huh? Are you going to order me around?

00:47:24.420 --> 00:47:27.120
Can I check if what the A-Zones are saying is true?

00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:34.810
Hey, stop it. You idiot.

00:47:35.850 --> 00:47:38.740
You broke my mood.

00:47:40.900 --> 00:47:43.330
How do I make sure?

00:47:44.270 --> 00:47:46.190
Anyway, I have to contact the guys in District A.

00:47:48.610 --> 00:47:50.190
Is there any way?

00:47:50.990 --> 00:47:53.940
Of course, open a free market.

00:47:56.410 --> 00:47:59.790
It's been a long time since I've been to the city.

00:48:00.060 --> 00:48:02.500
You might be able to meet the women of the A district.

00:48:02.680 --> 00:48:04.620
The A district?

00:48:06.520 --> 00:48:06.940
Alright.

00:48:07.720 --> 00:48:10.460
It's a market.

00:48:11.180 --> 00:48:14.710
Gather whatever you want from the A district.

00:48:16.360 --> 00:48:24.510
I have a stick.

00:48:24.770 --> 00:48:28.120
Take off your legs and head like this.

00:48:30.570 --> 00:48:31.590
This is an egg, okay?

00:48:32.150 --> 00:48:33.930
If you eat this, you'll get a stomachache.

00:48:34.670 --> 00:48:35.800
Got it?

00:48:35.960 --> 00:48:36.500
Got it.

00:48:36.580 --> 00:48:37.820
Okay, you can eat it.

00:48:38.200 --> 00:48:38.520
Okay.

00:48:38.640 --> 00:48:39.440
Chew it well.

00:48:39.780 --> 00:48:45.810
You guys are still like that.

00:48:46.910 --> 00:48:48.230
Good girl.

00:49:06.590 --> 00:49:08.190
You guys have come all the way here again?

00:49:08.570 --> 00:49:08.890
Ah!

00:49:09.150 --> 00:49:09.290
Mister!

00:49:09.900 --> 00:49:12.440
It's dangerous from here on, so you can't go.

00:49:13.060 --> 00:49:13.380
Alright.

00:49:13.980 --> 00:49:14.860
Now, it's my turn.

00:49:15.210 --> 00:49:16.030
Hey, look at that guy!

00:49:18.770 --> 00:49:20.330
There's a room for the mayor up ahead.

00:49:20.630 --> 00:49:23.200
He's bigger than Matt D'Arcy!

00:49:24.300 --> 00:49:24.620
Wait!

00:49:25.350 --> 00:49:28.060
He's not just big, he's also strong!

00:49:28.440 --> 00:49:29.900
This old man...

00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:30.440
What?

00:49:30.660 --> 00:49:33.060
I'm going to play with you.

00:49:33.140 --> 00:49:33.540
Okay.

00:49:47.920 --> 00:49:48.640
Well, then.

00:49:48.700 --> 00:49:51.040
Please come in.

00:49:54.770 --> 00:49:56.670
Well, thank you for your help.

00:49:56.890 --> 00:49:57.930
Thank you, thank you.

00:49:57.950 --> 00:49:59.170
No, and what is it?

00:49:59.170 --> 00:49:59.470
There is no exit.

00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:02.180
and was trapped in a gap in the concrete.

00:50:02.920 --> 00:50:04.420
That's a real pain in the ass.

00:50:04.560 --> 00:50:06.540
Now, please take a seat.

00:50:07.160 --> 00:50:10.600
It's not a big deal, but if you'd like, please.

00:50:11.160 --> 00:50:12.850
Here, would you like a beer?

00:50:13.510 --> 00:50:13.990
Please.

00:50:16.270 --> 00:50:20.460
I'm sorry, I don't feel like it.

00:50:20.880 --> 00:50:22.400
Yes, you may know me,

00:50:22.960 --> 00:50:25.740
but I'm Shibaki Tahei, a member of the House of Representatives.

00:50:25.860 --> 00:50:28.520
I'm the mayor of this district.

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:32.240
One more thing, thank you very much.

00:50:35.820 --> 00:50:38.100
So, what's your name?

00:50:38.690 --> 00:50:41.190
I forgot.

00:50:41.630 --> 00:50:43.200
Ah, I see.

00:50:43.520 --> 00:50:44.720
Loss of memory?

00:50:45.140 --> 00:50:46.720
That will happen again.

00:50:47.320 --> 00:50:47.720
However,

00:50:50.310 --> 00:50:56.430
I have something like this,

00:50:56.590 --> 00:50:58.740
so people call me Jack.

00:51:00.640 --> 00:51:02.000
It's called the Violence Jack.

00:51:03.480 --> 00:51:04.700
Well, well, well...

00:51:04.700 --> 00:51:07.360
It's a city at the bottom of the earth that sank in an earthquake.

00:51:07.360 --> 00:51:08.580
It's a name that's fitting for this hellish world.

00:51:10.840 --> 00:51:11.900
A hellish world?

00:51:13.560 --> 00:51:13.780
Yes.

00:51:13.940 --> 00:51:16.100
After the big earthquake half a year ago,

00:51:16.320 --> 00:51:18.120
the survivors gathered,

00:51:18.540 --> 00:51:20.540
and among them, those who were of the same mind

00:51:20.540 --> 00:51:23.450
were divided into three districts, District A, District B, and District C.

00:51:25.050 --> 00:51:27.530
They dreamed of going out on the ground one day,

00:51:27.530 --> 00:51:29.490
I'm going to live in this closed-off countryside.

00:51:30.920 --> 00:51:38.360
But even a decent human being will become strange if he lives in such a place for a long time.

00:51:38.940 --> 00:51:49.100
When the food reaches the bottom, the strong are strong, and the food and women are taken away and killed.

00:51:49.520 --> 00:51:52.780
Weak people are just living in hell, swallowing mud and eating insects.

00:52:01.050 --> 00:52:01.650
District C?

00:52:01.870 --> 00:52:05.060
Oh, there's nothing we can do about that.

00:52:05.260 --> 00:52:07.120
What are they thinking by being locked up in their own place?

00:52:09.940 --> 00:52:14.280
Rather than that, please stay here and protect us from the people of District B!

00:52:15.140 --> 00:52:17.400
Please, Jack-sama!

00:52:18.640 --> 00:52:18.900
Please!

00:52:20.030 --> 00:52:20.310
Please!

00:52:53.100 --> 00:52:57.350
Because the market will be crowded with people from the city, right?

00:52:57.950 --> 00:52:59.860
You drink too, come on!

00:53:01.660 --> 00:53:02.480
Oh, is that so?

00:53:03.760 --> 00:53:06.240
Don't talk! Hurry up and get your stuff!

00:53:06.760 --> 00:53:08.840
What? You're going to cook?

00:53:09.080 --> 00:53:10.080
You want me to be your opponent?

00:53:12.950 --> 00:53:18.410
It's pretty cold.

00:53:18.900 --> 00:53:21.350
If we gather this much, we'll be safe.

00:53:22.820 --> 00:53:24.160
Alright! I'm bringing it into the Free Zone!

00:53:46.920 --> 00:53:47.300
Mr. Sawamori!

00:53:47.540 --> 00:53:48.520
Mr. Buzou!

00:53:48.680 --> 00:53:49.440
What's up?

00:53:49.620 --> 00:53:52.070
The guys from District B have opened a market.

00:53:52.610 --> 00:53:53.050
What?

00:53:54.860 --> 00:53:55.740
I see.

00:53:56.220 --> 00:53:56.660
Good.

00:53:57.020 --> 00:53:57.880
Have Jack come.

00:54:02.620 --> 00:54:03.920
Welcome to the market!

00:54:04.340 --> 00:54:05.180
It's a market!

00:54:06.180 --> 00:54:07.400
It's a big market!

00:54:07.680 --> 00:54:09.280
Let's exchange with the original one!

00:54:10.720 --> 00:54:12.040
Hey, Chichikumo!

00:54:12.600 --> 00:54:14.250
Chichikumo, come here!

00:54:14.630 --> 00:54:21.900
It's him! Someone's boss!

00:55:03.000 --> 00:55:05.080
The royal family Mad Rider is a member of the B branch.

00:55:05.820 --> 00:55:10.550
Especially, that boss is a giant dinosaur called Mad Zaurus.

00:55:10.550 --> 00:55:12.180
It's a 200-kilogram monster.

00:55:13.650 --> 00:55:15.940
He's a good guy, isn't he?

00:55:15.940 --> 00:55:17.800
If the size fits, I want it.

00:55:18.850 --> 00:55:20.850
No, I'm just kidding.

00:55:31.310 --> 00:55:31.650
Hahaha!

00:55:33.080 --> 00:55:37.380
It seems that Kobun who went out to play won't come back because of you.

00:55:38.540 --> 00:55:43.660
That's Kobun. I crushed him again thinking he was a cockroach.

00:55:43.780 --> 00:55:46.400
The leader of cockroaches.

00:55:47.300 --> 00:55:48.580
W-what!?

00:55:48.580 --> 00:55:48.980
Wait!

00:55:49.260 --> 00:55:53.060
It's Shichiku.

00:56:08.640 --> 00:56:09.200
Niii-

00:56:43.180 --> 00:56:52.220
Mr. Jack, we're here to buy you.

00:56:52.480 --> 00:56:52.960
What?

00:56:53.700 --> 00:56:56.790
You are the power itself.

00:56:57.600 --> 00:56:59.520
And we, the C-Department, are...

00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:02.040
It's because they need that power the most out of hell.

00:57:02.680 --> 00:57:04.900
Wh- what are you trying to say?

00:57:05.140 --> 00:57:06.940
The name of this town is Jigokugai.

00:57:06.980 --> 00:57:08.990
It's a suitable name for a town buried deep in the earth.

00:57:09.870 --> 00:57:14.270
But the real reason it's called that is because of a certain incident.

00:57:14.990 --> 00:57:15.590
Stop it!

00:57:15.910 --> 00:57:17.070
What's the point of ignoring the fact that it's over?

00:57:18.490 --> 00:57:19.310
It's not over for us!

00:57:21.560 --> 00:57:23.580
Kiko...

00:57:25.780 --> 00:57:26.520
Oh?

00:57:30.670 --> 00:57:33.050
What's wrong? Why do you look so pale all of a sudden?

00:57:34.710 --> 00:57:36.670
Are you feeling unwell, everyone in the A district?

00:57:39.290 --> 00:57:41.530
It's been a month since I was buried alive.

00:57:41.730 --> 00:57:44.380
When I found out that all the entrances to the ground had been closed,

00:57:45.580 --> 00:57:47.950
the men started to pull out their fangs.

00:57:48.210 --> 00:57:50.140
No, I should say that it was their true nature.

00:57:51.040 --> 00:57:53.550
And the women were the ones who were sacrificed.

00:58:09.280 --> 00:58:13.440
Hehehehe, girls, are you sleeping well?

00:58:34.570 --> 00:58:36.800
Kaori-san, are you okay?

00:58:37.020 --> 00:58:37.400
Are you in trouble?

00:58:37.950 --> 00:58:39.770
Shibaki-san and the others just put Rikki and the others to sleep.

00:58:40.170 --> 00:58:42.990
You're the police, right?

00:58:43.150 --> 00:58:44.420
Then, where are you going?

00:58:44.500 --> 00:58:44.820
Stop it!

00:58:45.040 --> 00:58:45.360
Don't move!

00:58:45.680 --> 00:58:46.420
I don't have a bench.

00:58:47.100 --> 00:58:50.240
Even if I do this, I can't get out of here.

00:58:50.860 --> 00:58:55.560
Rather than just dying silently,

00:58:55.560 --> 00:58:57.400
it's better to do what you want to do and die.

00:59:00.570 --> 00:59:00.850
It's a human body.

00:59:00.930 --> 00:59:06.690
Kiramei, be human until the end.

00:59:06.690 --> 00:59:09.940
Don't move.

00:59:10.080 --> 00:59:13.310
I choose the one who hugs me rather than being killed.

00:59:55.280 --> 00:59:59.060
Thank you for watching this video.

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:06.670
And when they found out that there was still water and food in the basement, they put on the mask of the citizens again.

01:00:32.240 --> 01:00:33.720
You're not scared, are you?

01:00:33.720 --> 01:00:34.800
Even though you're not as bad as us,

01:00:35.840 --> 01:00:39.860
you don't have the guts to do it again, do you?

01:00:39.920 --> 01:00:41.360
Ho ho ho ho ho ho!

01:00:41.700 --> 01:00:46.180
For self-defense,

01:00:46.420 --> 01:00:47.520
we settled in District C.

01:00:48.140 --> 01:00:50.890
Even so, we were always being targeted.

01:00:51.330 --> 01:00:55.350
By the beasts of District B and District A.

01:00:56.270 --> 01:00:58.960
A woman is a flower when she's being targeted.

01:01:00.000 --> 01:01:03.280
Please, Jack-san! Please come to Shichiku!

01:01:03.880 --> 01:01:07.220
If you let me, I'll give you a jewel.

01:01:07.660 --> 01:01:17.570
If you wish, I'll give you our bodies.

01:01:35.884 --> 01:01:38.004
There seems to be no reason to refuse.

01:02:27.932 --> 01:02:29.052
I don't have much to eat.

01:02:32.040 --> 01:02:33.640
We are fashion models.

01:02:34.060 --> 01:02:36.740
Just before going to a show in Kyoto.

01:02:37.460 --> 01:02:41.490
That's why I'm used to the job description and food restrictions.

01:02:42.310 --> 01:02:44.630
I was also a fashion designer.

01:02:45.310 --> 01:02:47.310
Have you ever heard of Ira Moo?

01:02:48.890 --> 01:02:53.420
I'm sorry, it's just my story.

01:03:18.588 --> 01:03:19.328
Beautiful, isn't it?

01:03:24.540 --> 01:03:25.180
We are...

01:03:25.628 --> 01:03:27.628
The fact that I was locked up here...

01:03:27.868 --> 01:03:29.108
I don't think so.

01:03:31.630 --> 01:03:33.050
Because I was able to survive that earthquake.

01:03:34.230 --> 01:03:38.940
And again, luck has come to us.

01:03:39.000 --> 01:03:50.070
Jack, I believe in you.

01:03:50.170 --> 01:03:51.840
I believe in my own luck.

01:03:52.100 --> 01:03:55.320
And someday I will be able to escape to the blue sky.

01:04:00.860 --> 01:04:28.790
The closest

01:04:30.570 --> 01:04:31.940
Someday, we'll find the way to the ground.

01:05:22.590 --> 01:05:23.670
You can get out of here.

01:05:23.670 --> 01:05:24.430
It's true.

01:05:25.560 --> 01:05:27.900
Then, I have to tell the people in the other district as well.

01:05:32.204 --> 01:05:32.704
Eep!

01:06:02.910 --> 01:06:05.420
Go! I'll kill all of you pigs!

01:06:06.700 --> 01:06:25.660
I hate you!

01:06:39.980 --> 01:06:55.640
I don't want to see any more rookies.

01:06:55.640 --> 01:06:58.950
We can go to the ground together.

01:07:02.200 --> 01:07:12.600
K-Kawamori-san, I'm counting on you!

01:07:12.800 --> 01:07:22.000
I'll shoot!

01:07:22.280 --> 01:07:26.820
Don't be so stubborn, Naomei-san.

01:07:27.220 --> 01:07:29.060
I know what will happen if you shoot.

01:07:33.840 --> 01:07:34.120
I beg you.

01:07:34.300 --> 01:07:37.750
You're all survivors from that hell, aren't you?

01:07:37.970 --> 01:07:39.460
You can't fight any longer.

01:07:39.620 --> 01:07:40.700
It's too late.

01:07:41.630 --> 01:07:43.980
It's too late for me to come.

01:07:43.980 --> 01:07:49.980
They will continue to come here.

01:07:50.640 --> 01:07:51.700
Get out of here quickly.

01:07:52.000 --> 01:07:53.740
It's dangerous.

01:07:54.380 --> 01:07:55.100
No, I'll wait.

01:07:55.400 --> 01:07:56.860
I'm sure there are people who are running away from HQ.

01:08:23.680 --> 01:08:28.840
Mr. Kaomo, you're really good at this!

01:08:28.840 --> 01:08:29.970
We're B-

01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:31.040
You must live according to the rules.

01:08:31.820 --> 01:08:34.120
As expected, you have a good sense of propriety.

01:08:34.340 --> 01:08:36.440
Give up.

01:08:36.700 --> 01:08:37.770
You must surrender.

01:08:38.250 --> 01:08:38.630
Why?

01:08:39.590 --> 01:08:54.430
You know it, don't you?

01:08:54.990 --> 01:08:57.070
It's wonderful, Mr. Omawari.

01:09:00.000 --> 01:09:00.880
The rest are from Shichiku.

01:09:05.480 --> 01:09:10.030
Kawamori, you guys go ahead and kill Rikki and the others.

01:09:13.020 --> 01:09:15.080
It's Shichiku!

01:09:15.260 --> 01:09:18.370
You trust Kawamori?

01:09:19.690 --> 01:09:23.080
Don't tell me you're just going to use him until you kill Rikki, you idiot.

01:09:25.880 --> 01:09:28.830
Sora and Shichiku's woman is right in front of you!

01:09:31.310 --> 01:09:33.370
Huh? What's wrong, Bull?

01:09:34.150 --> 01:09:53.470
We meet again, the leader of the cockroaches.

01:09:53.910 --> 01:09:54.870
What?!

01:09:54.870 --> 01:09:58.400
But you can't get away from here.

01:09:58.520 --> 01:09:59.590
Hey, you!

01:10:00.000 --> 01:10:00.280
I'm your enemy!

01:10:34.990 --> 01:10:35.470
Jack!

01:10:35.810 --> 01:10:35.950
Jack!

01:10:35.950 --> 01:10:36.010
Jack!

01:11:38.610 --> 01:11:38.850
Heee!

01:11:38.850 --> 01:11:38.970
Heee!

01:12:00.000 --> 01:12:04.060
It's not over yet, Blue. I'll take care of this one.

01:12:04.060 --> 01:12:05.500
You guys go to District C.

01:12:06.020 --> 01:12:06.700
I got it!

01:12:08.120 --> 01:12:17.000
I'll take care of it!

01:12:17.700 --> 01:12:22.040
The sky is right there. I'll take care of it.

01:12:22.120 --> 01:12:28.770
I'll be the only survivor in District A.

01:12:32.460 --> 01:12:32.860
You're the only one left?

01:12:33.280 --> 01:12:37.610
You're a female wrestler?

01:12:37.910 --> 01:12:42.650
I'm going to the next gate somehow.

01:12:42.970 --> 01:12:43.880
I'll try to do it.

01:12:46.450 --> 01:12:47.090
You bastard!

01:12:53.710 --> 01:12:55.510
It doesn't ring, does it?

01:12:56.620 --> 01:12:57.180
It doesn't ring, does it?

01:12:57.600 --> 01:12:58.060
It doesn't ring, does it?

01:12:58.060 --> 01:12:58.280
I'll go to the market.

01:13:00.540 --> 01:13:01.140
It's fine, just go!

01:13:01.960 --> 01:13:02.340
Yes!

01:13:02.940 --> 01:13:05.360
I don't need anyone stronger than me!

01:13:30.800 --> 01:13:35.660
Rikki?

01:13:36.840 --> 01:13:38.800
Why are you still here?

01:13:38.960 --> 01:13:40.040
Because of Rikki.

01:13:40.260 --> 01:13:42.450
Everyone is ready to escape.

01:13:43.490 --> 01:13:49.740
If someone stays and doesn't stop them, everyone will be killed.

01:13:50.040 --> 01:13:51.750
But Jack...

01:13:51.750 --> 01:13:53.610
I'm enough here alone.

01:13:53.710 --> 01:13:55.930
