01:14:06.470 --> 01:14:10.110
I'll wait for you upstairs.

01:14:10.370 --> 01:14:10.610
Yeah.

01:14:13.170 --> 01:14:19.000
You're such an idiot to let me die.

01:14:30.000 --> 01:14:37.410
You're laughing, huh?

01:14:37.530 --> 01:14:38.800
You don't seem to be that big of a deal.

01:14:39.780 --> 01:14:40.490
Gah!

01:14:41.050 --> 01:14:45.380
Dorya!

01:15:03.100 --> 01:15:03.340
Thank you.

01:15:44.590 --> 01:15:53.500
I think I call it blah.

01:16:02.080 --> 01:16:03.770
Oh, the gate is open.

01:16:03.990 --> 01:16:04.860
No way.

01:16:04.920 --> 01:16:13.350
It's a dead end.

01:16:14.610 --> 01:16:16.360
I thought Aira and the others were dead.

01:16:31.692 --> 01:16:32.992
Just one more breath.

01:16:33.068 --> 01:16:34.328
The light of the sun

01:16:35.532 --> 01:16:36.452
It's beautiful.

01:16:36.940 --> 01:16:37.940
It's the light of the heavens!

01:16:42.252 --> 01:16:43.452
What was that sound?

01:16:44.492 --> 01:16:46.192
I'm going to take a look, so go ahead.

01:16:46.892 --> 01:16:47.752
Be careful!

01:16:47.788 --> 01:16:49.788
I'll be right back, so don't worry!

01:16:53.516 --> 01:16:54.016
