01:19:46.760 --> 01:19:47.500
It's a good feeling.

01:19:47.840 --> 01:19:50.620
Your body is honest.

01:19:51.240 --> 01:19:55.930
Aira, you're a good woman.

01:20:07.840 --> 01:20:08.580
Uwaaaah!

01:20:10.900 --> 01:20:11.220
Kuh!

01:20:11.460 --> 01:20:11.820
Die!

01:20:12.930 --> 01:20:13.050
You!

01:20:32.364 --> 01:20:33.024
Ha, ha, ha!

01:20:36.812 --> 01:20:37.312
Yeah!

01:22:06.970 --> 01:22:10.370
I will definitely avenge you guys.

01:22:11.650 --> 01:22:12.410
Definitely.

01:22:12.990 --> 01:22:29.070
I'm sorry.

01:22:31.020 --> 01:22:35.350
Don't be afraid of me. I'm your only friend.

01:22:37.350 --> 01:22:39.250
I'll take revenge on you.

01:22:39.990 --> 01:22:43.280
Maybe I'll die, too.

01:22:43.280 --> 01:22:45.480
Then we'll go to hell together again.

01:22:45.960 --> 01:22:48.550
Let's have fun in the real hell.

01:22:51.370 --> 01:22:56.340
