01:22:56.560 --> 01:22:58.970
Let's be together.

01:23:05.560 --> 01:23:22.910
Me... Mezemu...

01:23:22.910 --> 01:23:26.300
You're the best!

01:23:32.720 --> 01:23:35.100
Hahahaha

01:23:35.920 --> 01:23:45.550
You are my blood, my flesh, and my soul

01:23:46.650 --> 01:23:47.110
Jack!

01:24:12.890 --> 01:24:14.410
Wait a minute, Tsu-re-ta-ko-wa-na!

01:24:30.160 --> 01:24:32.720
Your destination is beyond your expectations.

01:24:33.620 --> 01:24:40.550
The sky is clear, the wind blows, and the sun shines on the earth.

01:24:41.670 --> 01:24:44.210
But that is a world that people should live in.

01:24:44.350 --> 01:24:48.320
It is not a world that hellish creatures like you should live in!

01:25:22.930 --> 01:25:23.630
you

01:25:31.760 --> 01:25:34.540
You think you can take revenge on your friends and your dead friends?

01:25:40.650 --> 01:25:47.700
No way!

01:25:48.900 --> 01:25:49.260
No way!

01:25:49.520 --> 01:25:53.900
No way!

01:25:53.900 --> 01:25:53.960
No way!

01:25:53.960 --> 01:25:55.110
No way!

01:26:14.270 --> 01:26:14.870
Jack-san, you're late.

01:26:15.310 --> 01:26:16.840
He'll be fine.

01:26:17.100 --> 01:26:23.440
