01:27:01.130 --> 01:27:05.900
I'm going to send you to that world, and I'm going to die!

01:27:06.540 --> 01:27:19.810
I'm going to send you to that world, and I'm going to die!

01:27:30.570 --> 01:27:32.250
Uh! uh! uh!

01:27:34.500 --> 01:27:53.440
You're a ninja!

01:27:54.190 --> 01:27:58.870
To you, I am the vehicle of Hell!

01:27:58.890 --> 01:27:59.730
Kyaa!

01:28:31.270 --> 01:28:38.090
Everyone, let's go together.

01:28:39.610 --> 01:28:42.310
Hell suits us.

01:29:30.092 --> 01:29:32.092
This is the land of our hope.

01:29:35.468 --> 01:29:36.168
This is...

01:29:37.100 --> 01:29:39.100
It's Tokyo until now.

01:29:41.388 --> 01:29:42.388
Cheer up.

01:29:42.636 --> 01:29:44.036
It's not like the usual Aira.

01:29:50.060 --> 01:29:51.660
There's the Earth and the Sun here.

01:29:51.660 --> 01:29:52.660
We can do anything.

01:29:52.812 --> 01:29:55.572
You're the one who brought us here.

01:29:58.156 --> 01:29:58.656
Thank you!

01:29:59.436 --> 01:29:59.936
That's right.

01:30:00.412 --> 01:30:02.792
Until now, we were the ones who were saved by Aira.

01:30:03.004 --> 01:30:03.764
From now on,

01:30:03.804 --> 01:30:05.604
It's time for us to save Aira.

01:30:06.044 --> 01:30:06.544
See you...

01:30:06.940 --> 01:30:08.680
Let's start over from scratch.

01:30:08.680 --> 01:30:11.120
That's right, that's the spirit, Aira. Let's do our best!

01:31:00.000 --> 01:31:29.980
