02:04:13.440 --> 02:04:17.380
What are you waiting for?

02:04:17.620 --> 02:04:19.150
Hurry up and put it away!

02:04:34.350 --> 02:04:40.360
Did you get poisoned?

02:04:40.720 --> 02:04:42.700
Alright, let's get going!

02:05:00.190 --> 02:05:04.390
Hey, are you okay?

02:05:04.610 --> 02:05:21.150
Are you okay? You can't tell by looking at me.

02:05:21.410 --> 02:05:23.720
That person...

02:05:32.620 --> 02:05:35.320
It's a terrible wound. How could it become like this?

02:05:35.880 --> 02:05:47.990
Take her to the town. Teyata will go first.

02:06:17.240 --> 02:06:18.100
Where's the signpost for the place they're going to?

02:06:18.860 --> 02:06:19.620
Well...

02:06:20.500 --> 02:06:21.300
Come to think of it,

02:06:21.300 --> 02:06:23.860
about 20 km west from here,

02:06:23.860 --> 02:06:26.160
there used to be a base town.

02:06:26.820 --> 02:06:29.540
That base has become their hideout.

02:06:31.500 --> 02:06:33.580
I don't know if it's true or not.

02:06:36.610 --> 02:06:37.610
That's enough.

02:06:38.210 --> 02:06:39.970
Are you really going?

02:06:40.780 --> 02:06:43.080
Why are you chasing the health window so much?

02:06:43.920 --> 02:06:47.270
Aren't you afraid?

02:06:47.770 --> 02:06:48.950
Even if you make the city like this!

02:06:49.410 --> 02:06:52.780
If you didn't come, everyone would have lived without dying.

02:06:53.420 --> 02:06:54.950
If you didn't come!

02:06:55.270 --> 02:06:55.970
That's right!

02:06:56.470 --> 02:06:57.660
You killed it!

02:07:02.970 --> 02:07:06.450
Even if you go on your own, you won't win.

02:07:06.610 --> 02:07:08.970
Win? I haven't won since the beginning.

02:07:09.450 --> 02:07:11.130
But I will go.

02:07:11.210 --> 02:07:11.970
I have to defeat them all.

02:07:13.230 --> 02:07:15.300
My battle will not end!

02:07:30.540 --> 02:07:33.330
Everyone, let's go get the teacher with the weapon!

02:07:33.930 --> 02:07:43.100
What's wrong?

02:07:43.420 --> 02:07:44.880
That girl...

02:07:45.160 --> 02:07:45.860
I said it alone!

02:07:46.200 --> 02:07:49.890
If we all work together and fight, we can save Sensei!

02:07:50.230 --> 02:07:52.330
Are you going to kill such a good sensei?

02:07:53.090 --> 02:07:54.460
Eh? Dad!

02:07:54.760 --> 02:07:56.710
If it's Dad, he'll go, right?

02:07:57.260 --> 02:07:58.540
What's wrong with you, Dad?!

02:08:00.000 --> 02:08:00.500
Samuro!

02:08:00.508 --> 02:08:01.008
Ha!

02:08:01.948 --> 02:08:03.908
Don't you dare open your eyes!

02:08:04.124 --> 02:08:05.924
The teacher, and the person who just left...

02:08:05.980 --> 02:08:07.520
I don't feel like I'm going home anymore!

02:08:07.804 --> 02:08:08.804
Forget about it!

02:08:08.924 --> 02:08:10.164
It was a storm.

02:08:10.332 --> 02:08:12.072
The storm has already passed.

02:08:12.072 --> 02:08:14.512
The teachers are the victims of that storm.

02:08:14.684 --> 02:08:16.044
It can't be helped!

02:08:16.044 --> 02:08:20.604
Is that an adult or my father?

02:08:20.764 --> 02:08:21.564
That's enough!

02:08:21.596 --> 02:08:23.136
Let's go, just the two of us!

02:08:23.228 --> 02:08:25.328
I'll save my teacher!

02:08:25.328 --> 02:08:26.128
Saburou!

02:08:26.172 --> 02:08:26.972
WAIT!

02:08:27.676 --> 02:08:28.516
I'll go.

02:08:30.700 --> 02:08:31.560
Thank you.

02:08:32.268 --> 02:08:35.268
But it's not that serious of an injury, but I can't do it!

02:08:35.280 --> 02:08:38.040
Bring my body to him.

02:08:38.476 --> 02:08:39.916
By the time you get there...

02:08:40.172 --> 02:08:41.472
You'll be able to move.

02:08:41.472 --> 02:08:44.672
I can't! I can't heal in such a short time!

02:08:44.844 --> 02:08:45.564
I'll...

02:08:45.772 --> 02:08:48.172
You think I'm Violence Jack?

02:09:24.730 --> 02:09:27.120
Ha ha ha, what a great view.

02:09:27.660 --> 02:09:29.580
I can't believe it's so rare these days.

02:09:30.000 --> 02:09:30.560
She is a wonderful woman.

02:09:31.120 --> 02:09:35.380
If you are here, she will come here.

02:09:35.860 --> 02:09:39.250
Until then, you have to keep her alive.

02:09:48.890 --> 02:09:52.730
Boss, will she really come?

02:09:53.170 --> 02:09:57.060
Yes, she will come.

02:10:00.000 --> 02:10:06.620
The military base is being used as a hideout.

02:10:06.660 --> 02:10:07.990
The weapons should be ready.

02:10:08.350 --> 02:10:11.870
We can't break through at once.

02:10:12.030 --> 02:10:13.420
What should we do?

02:10:38.990 --> 02:10:42.320
Yakuza, it's uncomfortable to ride because of the bad blood. Please be patient.

02:10:43.100 --> 02:10:55.640
Please do it for me.

02:11:00.000 --> 02:11:08.110
Damn it! We always end up acting like this!

02:11:08.530 --> 02:11:10.750
I want to try acting like a good girl like that too!

02:11:11.910 --> 02:11:15.690
But you know, with such a cute face, you look like a real man!

02:11:34.320 --> 02:11:34.920
Ugh...

02:11:35.520 --> 02:11:40.880
Disappear at any time!

02:11:41.180 --> 02:11:41.440
Oh!

02:12:01.600 --> 02:12:02.600
I'm going to get you!

02:12:37.710 --> 02:12:43.110
That's strange. She should know that I'm here, but she doesn't welcome me at all.

02:13:49.930 --> 02:13:51.990
Now, Teru. Let me hear your answer.

02:13:53.530 --> 02:13:57.930
Eh? Tsugiru!

02:14:01.980 --> 02:14:05.390
There's no one who can beat Luswind.

02:14:10.580 --> 02:14:28.310
Yeah, I know.

02:14:34.320 --> 02:14:36.410
Jack, how are the wounds? Can you fight?

02:14:36.850 --> 02:14:38.760
Yeah, somehow.

02:14:39.160 --> 02:14:48.200
Hey, Jack! If you don't hurry, that big sister will get hurt too!

02:14:48.540 --> 02:14:50.000
It's too late!

02:14:50.080 --> 02:14:50.320
Huh?

02:14:50.480 --> 02:14:51.650
Saburo!

02:14:52.030 --> 02:14:52.350
What?

02:14:53.240 --> 02:14:54.740
I'll go on my own from here.

02:14:54.980 --> 02:14:55.580
Huh?!

02:14:55.580 --> 02:14:57.560
Wait here until the two of you come back.

02:14:59.290 --> 02:14:59.730
Y-

02:15:00.890 --> 02:15:01.650
I'm coming too!

02:15:01.870 --> 02:15:06.680
No. If they come here, you will fight.

02:15:08.640 --> 02:15:11.650
You will fight for yourself.

02:15:47.310 --> 02:15:50.810
Take a look at this defenseless figure.

02:15:51.130 --> 02:15:54.100
It's so cute and precious that it makes me tremble.

02:15:56.100 --> 02:15:58.890
Joker, your knife is bleeding fast.

02:16:00.000 --> 02:16:00.600
That's what I'm saying!

02:16:00.960 --> 02:16:02.400
Are you sure, boss?

02:16:03.100 --> 02:16:05.240
Yeah, play as you like.

02:16:05.460 --> 02:16:07.760
Thank you.

02:16:14.910 --> 02:16:26.400
This will be my work of art.

02:16:30.000 --> 02:16:41.880
If I didn't have that disgusting confidence, I would have been doing this with clay and stones.

02:16:47.080 --> 02:16:52.040
The line here is difficult. I wonder if I can draw it beautifully.

02:16:52.400 --> 02:16:55.230
How do you feel?

02:16:55.570 --> 02:16:56.870
It's amazing.

02:17:04.800 --> 02:17:06.860
To be able to tell a human's fate...

02:17:07.160 --> 02:17:09.680
It's quite a feeling, isn't it?

02:17:13.200 --> 02:17:16.600
This is already a world for just the two of us!

02:17:17.120 --> 02:17:25.220
It's a wonderful art!

02:17:31.180 --> 02:17:35.620
It would be even more beautiful if I added some Arawata.

02:17:49.440 --> 02:17:51.920
Around here?

02:17:53.000 --> 02:17:58.980
It's here, I knew it.

02:18:20.410 --> 02:18:24.660
If you say someone would use such a big knife, it must be Jack!

02:18:24.940 --> 02:18:26.600
No way! Yata is dead!

02:18:27.120 --> 02:18:28.400
B-But...

02:18:28.400 --> 02:18:29.340
Isn't it Jack?

02:18:30.000 --> 02:18:38.450
What the hell is going on?

02:19:00.000 --> 02:19:01.750
Jack, you're still alive?

02:19:02.340 --> 02:19:07.080
You're useless cockroaches in this Kanto.

02:19:07.200 --> 02:19:09.800
In order to crush those cockroaches,

02:19:09.800 --> 02:19:13.620
I'll crawl up from the bottom of hell again and again.

02:19:14.190 --> 02:19:16.080
You're making me laugh.

02:19:16.480 --> 02:19:20.780
There's no such thing as being called a cockroach by a rat.

02:19:21.160 --> 02:19:23.360
You guys, do it!

02:20:46.480 --> 02:20:49.580
You! You have to hurry and ask for help from your parents!

02:20:49.780 --> 02:20:50.220
Yes!

02:20:50.480 --> 02:20:57.720
Good luck!

02:21:02.110 --> 02:21:11.720
Hehehehe...

02:21:12.450 --> 02:21:14.570
Jack! You're the last one!

02:21:14.910 --> 02:21:19.680
If you get caught in this Stinger missile, monsters like you will be finished in one blow!

02:21:20.360 --> 02:21:25.210
If you're not here, you'll be living in this Kanto for the rest of your life!

02:21:26.230 --> 02:21:29.070
Heh... I wonder what will happen...

02:21:32.940 --> 02:21:34.740
Jack is... Jack is in danger!

02:21:35.000 --> 02:21:35.180
What?

02:21:44.060 --> 02:21:45.320
Do it, Bokubon!

02:22:10.650 --> 02:22:11.170
I did it!

02:22:12.220 --> 02:22:14.890
Now the troublemaker has disappeared!

02:22:19.200 --> 02:22:22.680
What's wrong? Why are you so sad?

02:22:23.040 --> 02:22:24.560
Laugh! Laugh!

02:22:24.900 --> 02:22:26.870
There's nothing to be happy about, right?

02:22:42.060 --> 02:22:43.860
It can't be! It can't be!

02:22:43.880 --> 02:22:45.700
It's not over yet, Kugao!

02:22:45.840 --> 02:22:46.120
What?

02:23:01.850 --> 02:23:02.350
AHHHHH!

02:23:45.410 --> 02:23:47.360
Ah! Ah! Ah!

02:23:48.170 --> 02:23:50.870
My leg! My leg! My leg!

02:23:51.210 --> 02:23:52.930
Fufufufu...

02:23:53.620 --> 02:23:57.650
I can't do anything without the bike!

02:23:57.810 --> 02:23:59.690
Don't come near me!

02:24:00.410 --> 02:24:03.300
P-Please don't kill me...

02:24:03.300 --> 02:24:06.530
P-Please don't kill me...

02:24:06.530 --> 02:24:08.030
Go to hell, you bastard!

02:24:08.880 --> 02:24:11.020
No! Stop it!

02:25:02.910 --> 02:25:04.560
Chuck, thank you so much!

02:25:04.960 --> 02:25:08.210
I didn't hear your name.

02:25:09.510 --> 02:25:14.770
Me? My name is Tenma Masaburo!

02:25:14.970 --> 02:25:27.470
Tenma, grow up quickly.

02:25:27.510 --> 02:25:29.400
Kanto is like you.

02:25:30.000 --> 02:25:34.880
I'm sure we'll meet again someday.

02:25:35.380 --> 02:25:38.480
No, we'll definitely meet.

02:26:31.020 --> 02:26:31.280
Thank you.
